---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="SLA · DefendableCloud" description="DefendableCloud service-level posture for enterprise customers." path="/sla">
  <Nav />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-honey-300">SLA</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-paper">Service-level posture</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-paper/70">
      DefendableCloud is in controlled launch. Enterprise SLAs are contract-based and depend on deployment model, support tier, and data residency needs.
    </p>
    <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/65">
      <li class="rounded-lg border border-white/8 bg-white/[0.02] p-4">Target production availability: 99.9% for hosted API/app surfaces after enterprise GA.</li>
      <li class="rounded-lg border border-white/8 bg-white/[0.02] p-4">SEV-1 response target: same business day during launch; contract-specific after GA.</li>
      <li class="rounded-lg border border-white/8 bg-white/[0.02] p-4">Backups and restore drills are defined in the operational runbooks.</li>
    </ul>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
